    Input profiles (Geo.INPUT_*, from DeviceSettings.inputButtons):
      A   five buttons and touch: the fēnix, epix, MARQ, Descent, Enduro and
          D2 watches, fr955, fr965, fr970. MENU = hold UP.
      A0  the same buttons, no touch: fr255, fr255m. Every action has to be
          reachable by buttons alone (it is on A as well, with touch off).
      B   START, BACK and touch, MENU = hold BACK: venu3, venu3s.
      C   START, BACK and touch, no MENU at all: vivoactive6, venu441mm,
          venu445mm, venux1. Garmin's action menu indicator and onActionMenu
          (API 5.1.1, guarded with `has`) stand in for MENU (ui/InputProfile.mc).

