    device's api.debug.xml): Toybox.Complications, Toybox.PersistedContent
    and WatchUi.GlanceView. Memory: watch-app budget 786,432 B and glance
    budget 65,536 B everywhere, except fr255 with a watch-app budget of
    524,288 B.

